    "turn_text": "I mean, listen, the Affordable Care Act did deliver better coverage. But I also, the real point. in terms of why don't like a single payer plan is we don't have any evidence. I hear what you're saying about how under their bill they're going to create this better plan. But we've got 50 years of data to suggest that the government just doesn't do that. because of budget issues.",
